<title>PERU: TABLE - Peru's Edelnor 6-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Peru's Edelnor 6-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 65.9 million soles vs 60.1 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 386.3 million soles vs 343.8 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Edelnor is an electricty distributor controlled by the Distrilima consortium composed of Spain's Endesa and Chilean companies Enersis and Chilectra.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
